      "kind": "inedito",
      "question": "Escribe en Python rle_bytes(data: bytes) -> bytes que codifique por longitud de racha: por cada racha de un mismo byte emite dos bytes (longitud, valor), con longitud máxima 255 (las rachas más largas se parten). b'' devuelve b''.",
      "load_seconds": 44.8,
      "tokens": {
        "entrada": 790,
        "salida": 540
      },
      "answer": "```python\ndef rle_bytes(data: bytes) -> bytes:\n    if not data:\n        return b''\n    \n    result = bytearray()\n    i = 0\n    n = len(data)\n    \n    while i < n:\n        current_byte = data[i]\n        count = 0\n        \n        # Count consecutive identical bytes\n        while i + count < n and data[i + count] == current_byte and count < 255:\n            count += 1\n        \n        result.append(count)\n        result.append(current_byte)\n        \n        i += count\n        \n    return bytes(result)\n```",
